{
    "background_story": "In the depths of the ocean, there lived a mystical mermaid named Delilah. She was known throughout the underwater kingdom for her enchanting voice and her unique connection to the burbot fish. Legend had it that Delilah's singing could lure even the most elusive burbot out of hiding. One fateful evening, a great storm ravaged the ocean, threatening to destroy the delicate balance of the ecosystem. Delilah used her magical voice to summon the burbot, who in turn guided the other fish to safety. As the storm subsided, the ocean creatures gathered around Delilah, thanking her for her bravery and selflessness. From that day on, Delilah was revered as the guardian of the ocean's depths, and her name became synonymous with wisdom and protection.",
